        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Lawn Mower Pro + Snow Blower bundle pairs the Yarbo Core with two modules, so one machine handles your lawn from spring through fall and your driveway all winter.</p><p><strong>Spring Through Fall</strong><br/>The Lawn Mower Pro Module covers up to 6.2 acres per cycle with dual 300W motors and 20 adjustable cutting heights from 0.8\" to 4.0\".</p><p><strong>Winter</strong><br/>The Snow Blower Module clears a 24\" path, throwing snow up to 40 feet, and starts automatically when snow falls.</p><p><strong>One Core, Two Seasons</strong><br/>Swap modules in minutes. The Core's tracked chassis climbs 70% (35°) slopes where wheeled machines fail.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>The Autonomous Estate. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p><strong>Two seasons, one machine.</strong></p><p>This bundle includes a Yarbo Core, a Lawn Mower Pro Module, and a Snow Blower Module, giving you autonomous lawn care from spring through fall and autonomous snow clearing all winter.</p><h3>Lawn Mower Pro Module</h3><p>Dual 300W motors (2,500W peak) cut up to 6.2 acres per cycle, with cutting height adjustable from 0.8\" to 4.0\" across 20 settings.</p><h3>Snow Blower Module</h3><p>24\" clearing width, 12\" intake height, and up to 40 feet of throw distance. Connects to live weather forecasting to start clearing automatically when snow falls.</p><h3>Built for real terrain</h3><p>The Core's tracked drive system and 70% (35°) climbing ability take on slopes and rough ground that stop wheeled robots.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Yarbo’s standard 2 year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, beginning from the date your machine is activated. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Setup takes approximately 60–90 minutes. The Yarbo app guides you through boundary mapping using RTK GPS no physical wire installation required. Compatible with iOS and Android.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Lawn Mower Pro Module</h3><ul><li><strong>Motors:</strong> Dual 300W, 2,500W peak power</li><li><strong>Cutting width:</strong> 20 inches</li><li><strong>Cutting height:</strong> 0.8 to 4.0 inches, 20 adjustable settings</li><li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Up to 6.2 acres at twice-weekly mowing cycles</li></ul><h3>Snow Blower Module</h3><ul><li><strong>Clearing width:</strong> 24 inches</li><li><strong>Intake height:</strong> 12 inches</li><li><strong>Throw distance:</strong> 6 to 40 feet (adjustable)</li><li><strong>Operating temperature:</strong> -13°F to 140°F (extendable to -40°F with optional heating modules)</li></ul><h3>Yarbo Core</h3><ul><li><strong>Navigation:</strong> RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM</li><li><strong>Climbing ability:</strong> 70% (35°)</li><li><strong>Towing capacity:</strong> 500 lbs daily, 3,500 lbs max rolling weight</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow</li></ul><h3>Warranty & Shipping</h3><ul><li><strong>Warranty:</strong> Yarbo's standard 2-year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, from activation date</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> approximately 10 to 14 days after payment</li></ul>"
          }
        },
